  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Core Features**\n\nI\'ve been solidifying the core features. Focusing on true black OLED dark mode, that\'s crucial for nighttime reading comfort. Then, fast offline search using SQLite FTS across all those books. Finally, I\'m thinking of a daily verse card on the home screen with sharing and bookmarking. This should cover the essentials.\n\n\n**Analyzing Implementation Path**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the implementation specifics. I\'ve evaluated my Android skills and design knowledge, focusing on Material 3. I\'ve also scoped the project, noting the use of Room, Compose, and Material 3, then I\'ve checked the design guidelines. Finally, I\'ve created an implementation plan document to be reviewed for the project!\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_204037"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Comprehensive implementation plan for Holy Bible - KJV 1611 Android App featuring offline SQLite storage, FTS search, True Black OLED dark mode, 66 books, bookmarks, and Verse of the Day.\",\"UserFacing\":true},\"CodeContent\":\"# Holy Bible - KJV 1611 Android App Implementation Plan\\n\\nA feature-rich, high-performance offline King James Version (1611) Bible reading and search application built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3, and Room SQLite database.\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - **Dark Mode**: User selected **True black OLED dark mode** for a peaceful nighttime reading experience.\\n> - **Search**: User selected **Fast SQLite FTS offline search across all 66 books**.\\n> - **Verse of the Day**: User selected **Daily Verse card on home screen with share and bookmark options**.\\n\\n- **Confirmed Decision 1**: Complete offline KJV dataset bundled in Room database (all 39 Old Testament books, 27 New Testament books, chapters, and verses).\\n- **Confirmed Decision 2**: Navigation via Jetpack Navigation Compose with a sleek bottom bar (Home, Books, Search, Bookmarks).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n- **What It Does**: Provides a distraction-free, lightning-fast Bible reading experience with full offline search, bookmarking, verse copying/sharing, daily verse inspiration, and reading position persistence.\\n- **Target Audience / Persona**: Christians and Bible scholars seeking a reverent, clean, offline-first study and reading app optimized for Android devices.\\n- **Key Value**: 100% offline capability, zero registration required, instant full-text search, and gorgeous OLED dark-mode aesthetics.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n- **Key User Flows**:\\n  1. **Splash Screen**: Launch with glowing golden cross and peaceful deep navy branding, fading smoothly into Home.\\n  2. **Home Screen**: Features \\\"Continue Reading\\\" card, Verse of the Day card, quick jump to Old / New Testament, and search shortcut.\\n  3. **Bible Browsing**: Select Testament -> Book -> Chapter -> Verse reader.\\n  4. **Verse Action Sheet**: Tap any verse to Copy, Share, or Bookmark.\\n  5. **Search Screen**: Type keywords or references (e.g., \\\"John 3:16\\\", \\\"love\\\", \\\"faith\\\") to instantly find matching verses with highlighted terms.\\n  6. **Bookmarks Screen**: Manage saved verses with quick navigation back to the source chapter.\\n\\n- **Visual Identity & Theme**:\\n  - *Aesthetic Direction*: Peaceful, sacred, and minimalist Christian aesthetic.\\n  - *Color Palette & Mood*: True black background (`#0B0D12`), Deep Royal Navy (`#111827`), Rich Gold accents (`#D4AF37` / `#E5C158`), and Crisp Warm White typography (`#F9FAFB`).\\n  - *Typography & Hierarchy*: Material 3 typography with clean serif/sans-serif pairing for maximum legibility during long reading sessions.\\n  - *Component Styling*: Rounded cards with subtle gold outlines and elevation, generous touch targets (min 48dp).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Decision 1**: Bundled Room SQLite Database with Pre-populated KJV Verses.\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Include a robust SQLite database asset or programmatic initial seeding of KJV verses on first launch.\\n  - *Why*: Guarantees instant 100% offline access without network requests or large asset file download bottlenecks.\\n- **Decision 2**: FTS4 (Full Text Search) in SQLite.\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Use SQLite FTS4 virtual tables for lightning-fast keyword searches across thousands of verses.\\n  - *Why*: Sub-millisecond response times even on budget Android devices.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                        UI Layer                        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202   (Jetpack Compose + Material 3 + Navigation Compose)  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                            \342\224\202 StateFlow / Actions\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                    ViewModel Layer                     \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202    (BibleViewModel, SearchViewModel, BookmarkVM)       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                            \342\224\202 Repository Pattern\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                    Data & Storage Layer                \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202       (Room Database + FTS4 Virtual Table + DAO)       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n```\\n\\n- **Data Model & Entities**:\\n  - `BookEntity`: id, name, testament (\\\"OT\\\" or \\\"NT\\\"), totalChapters, bookOrder\\n  - `VerseEntity`: id, bookId, chapter, verseNum, text\\n  - `BookmarkEntity`: id, bookId, bookName, chapter, verseNum, text, timestamp\\n  - `ReadingPositionEntity`: id, bookId, bookName, chapter, verseNum, timestamp\\n- **Key Modules to Implement**:\\n  1. `Database & Seeding`: `BibleDatabase.kt`, `BibleDao.kt`, `BookEntity.kt`, `VerseEntity.kt`, `BookmarkEntity.kt`, `ReadingPositionEntity.kt`. Preload all 66 books and essential verses (Genesis, Psalms, Gospels, Revelation, etc., plus full complete Bible generation utility or robust seed dataset of KJV texts).\\n  2. `Repositories`: `BibleRepository.kt` managing local queries, FTS search, bookmarks, and reading progress.\\n  3. `ViewModels`: `BibleViewModel.kt` handling UI state, current book/chapter navigation, search query flow, and bookmarks.\\n  4. `UI Composables`:\\n     - `SplashActivity` / `SplashScreen.kt`: Reverent deep navy & gold cross launch animation.\\n     - `HomeScreen.kt`: Continue reading, Verse of the Day, OT/New Testament cards, quick search.\\n     - `BooksScreen.kt`: Tabbed or grouped Old/New Testament book picker.\\n     - `ChapterScreen.kt`: Chapter reader with adjustable font size, verse tapping for copy/share/bookmark.\\n     - `SearchScreen.kt`: Offline instant keyword & reference search with highlighted terms.\\n     - `BookmarksScreen.kt`: List of saved verses.\\n     - `BottomNav.kt`: Clean navigation bar.\\n\",\"Description\":\"Write implementation plan for Holy Bible KJV Android app\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/workspace/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/261e1b97-af08-4295-abae-fa0ff0aeefe7/implementation_plan.md\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing implementation plan\",\"toolSummary\":\"Write implementation plan\"}"
