  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Data Layer**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing the Room database structure. Right now, I\'m defining the `BookEntity` with its properties: `id`, `name`, and `testament` which will be \"OT\" or \"NT\". This foundational entity is the starting point for modeling the Bible data.\n\n\n**Defining Data Tables**\n\nI\'ve expanded the `VerseEntity` to include `bookId`, `chapter`, `verseNum`, and `text`, along with FTS support via `VerseFts`. I\'ve also defined `BookmarkEntity` and `ReadingPositionEntity` for user interactions. The `BibleDao` will handle all data queries, and I\'m planning a comprehensive seeding strategy for the `BibleDatabase`, ensuring all books and chapters have sample verses, including famous chapters for a complete feel.\n\n\n**Outlining User Interface**\n\nI\'m now focusing on UI components. I\'ve drafted `Theme.kt` with a dark theme and `SplashScreen.kt` with a golden cross. I\'m also planning the `HomeScreen.kt`, including a \"Continue Reading\" card, Verse of the Day, and quick access to testaments. I\'m working on the design for other screens, such as `BooksScreen.kt`, `ChapterListScreen.kt`, `ChapterReaderScreen.kt`, and `SearchScreen.kt`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
