    response: "I have successfully created and built the **Holy Bible \342\200\223 KJV 1611** Android application.\n\n### Summary of Features Implemented:\n1. **Christian Splash Screen**: Deep navy gradient background with a glowing golden cross, elegant typography, and Psalm 119:105 tagline, automatically navigating to the home screen after initialization.\n2. **Home Screen**: Features a Continue Reading card, Verse of the Day inspirational card (with copy, share, and bookmark actions), quick access cards for Old and New Testaments, and search shortcut.\n3. **Complete Bible Browsing (All 66 Books)**: Grouped under Old Testament (39 books) and New Testament (27 books) with chapter counts, chapter selection grid, and chapter reader with previous/next navigation.\n4. **Distraction-Free Bible Reading**: Serif typography with adjustable font size (A- / A+), clear verse numbers, and a bottom sheet when tapping any verse to **Copy**, **Share**, or **Bookmark**.\n5. **Offline Bible Search**: Fast offline SQLite-backed search supporting both keyword lookups and Bible references (e.g., *John 3:16*, *Psalm 23*), navigating directly to the selected verse upon tap.\n6. **Verse of the Day**: Deterministic daily verse selection displayed on the home screen with share and bookmark capabilities.\n7. **Local Bookmarks & Sharing**: Room-powered local storage for saved verses, accessible via the Bookmarks tab with quick removal and jump-to-reading functions.\n8. **True Black OLED Theme**: Designed with a peaceful True Black (`#000000`) and Deep Navy aesthetic paired with Rich Gold (`#D4AF37`) accents and warm white serif typography for optimal nighttime reading."
    thinking: "**Verifying Core Requirements**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the build was successful; the applet compiled without errors. Now I\'m methodically verifying the essential requirements detailed in the user prompt. I\'ve double-checked the app name, \"Holy Bible \342\200\223 KJV 1611,\" in both `metadata.json` and `strings.xml`. Next, I\'m focusing on the splash screen, specifically the deep navy background.\n\n\n"
