  user_input {
    user_response: "Configure the release build with R8 minification (isMinifyEnabled = true, isShrinkResources = true) and ndk.debugSymbolLevel = SYMBOL_TABLE. Keep the existing signingConfig lines unchanged. Add the necessary ProGuard/R8 keep rules in proguard-rules.pro for all libraries and data classes used in the app (Room/SQLite models, serialization, etc.) so the release build behaves identically to the debug build."
    items {
      text: "Configure the release build with R8 minification (isMinifyEnabled = true, isShrinkResources = true) and ndk.debugSymbolLevel = SYMBOL_TABLE. Keep the existing signingConfig lines unchanged. Add the necessary ProGuard/R8 keep rules in proguard-rules.pro for all libraries and data classes used in the app (Room/SQLite models, serialization, etc.) so the release build behaves identically to the debug build."
    }
